 "deficit_push_up": "Perform the Deficit Push Up with smooth, controlled form. One rep is one full, controlled movement from start to finish and back.",
 "depth_drop_to_broad_jump": "You need a sturdy box. Perform the Depth Drop To Broad Jump with smooth, controlled form. One rep is one run of the prescribed distance at the effort shown; walk back slowly to rest.",
 "dl_bat_speed_overload_ladder": "You need weighted bats. 3 heavy then 3 standard then 3 light, blast pod recording each set. One rep is one full, controlled movement from start to finish and back.",
 "dl_jband_series": "You need a resistance band. External rotation, diagonals, Y-T-W-L pulls — 10 each, controlled. One rep is one full, controlled movement from start to finish and back.",
 "dl_lateral_bound_to_throw": "You need a medicine ball. Lateral bound off back leg, stick land, deliver throw or med-ball. One rep is one throw. Do every rep on one side, then switch sides.",
 "dl_med_ball_shotput": "You need a medicine ball. Load rear hip, shove med-ball into wall like a shotput, follow through. One rep is one throw.",
 "dl_pivot_pickoff_throw": "Quick pivot from set, snap short-arm throw, hit target the prescribed distance away. One rep is one throw.",
 "dl_plyo_pivot_pickoff": "You need a plyo ball. Athletic stance, quick pivot, snap plyo to wall, receive with soft hands. One rep is one throw.",
 "dl_plyo_reverse_throw": "You need a plyo ball. 1kg plyo, wind-up to backward throw against wall, catch cleanly. One rep is one throw.",
 "dl_step_back_swing": "You need weighted bats. Overload bat, step-back gather, drive rear hip through contact. One rep is one full, controlled movement from start to finish and back.",
 "dl_underload_swing_speed": "You need a speed stick. Speed stick, max intent 8 swings, focus late torso rotation. One rep is one full, controlled movement from start to finish and back.",
 "dl_weighted_ball_hold": "You need a weighted ball. Rocker throw with 2lb weighted ball, decelerate long into finish. Hold the position for the prescribed number of seconds; that is one rep.",
