 "dowel_assisted_ninety_ninety_stretch": "You need a dowel or broomstick. Perform the Dowel Assisted Ninety Ninety Stretch with smooth, controlled form. One rep is one full, controlled movement from start to finish and back.",
 "dumbbell_bench_press": "You need two dumbbells and a bench. Perform the Dumbbell Bench Press with smooth, controlled form. One rep is one full, controlled movement from start to finish and back.",
 "dumbbell_crunch": "You need two dumbbells. Perform the Dumbbell Crunch with smooth, controlled form. One rep is one full, controlled movement from start to finish and back.",
